msgid "RC Transmitter Flight Mode Configuration"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration.rst:7
#: 8732a60245b74561935943c796e54c65
msgid "This article shows how you can enable up to 6 autopilot control/flight modes to be set from your RC transmitter via the flight mode channel (:ref:`FLTMODE_CH<FLTMODE_CH>` for plane/copter/sub, :ref:`MODE_CH<MODE_CH>` for rover). Flight mode changes can also be made via RC channels setup as :ref:`common-auxiliary-functions`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration.rst:12
#: 726ee4d50f0f45ad8f1fb14efe368902
msgid "Flight modes configuration"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration.rst:26
#: 2afd002f729845e2bc0a4383b18cf71e
msgid "Flight modes are assigned to up to 6 PWM ranges for the :ref:`FLTMODE_CH<FLTMODE_CH>`. This is done via the GCS parameter editor. See :ref:`Sub modes<modes>` for the available operating modes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration.rst:30
#: 31a6e0c0b23245ec8f65b1ddbd86dc79
msgid "Setting the flight mode channel"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration.rst:32
#: 57df0df2ed4f4a9cb53d50e626b8c85b
msgid "The flight mode channel is the input radio channel that ArduPilot monitors for mode changes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration.rst:39
#: b12244df9ba8483fb21ca3c97b155ec2
msgid "By default, :ref:`FLTMODE_CH<FLTMODE_CH>` is set to \"0\", disabling the ability to select modes via RC, but can be set to any otherwise unused available RC channel."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration.rst:42
#: 5d3d28b315f2458e887adf0e6a1e71d8
msgid "Transmitter configuration"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration.rst:44
#: 220bed6d53074adbaad57baff5f49a56
msgid "The transmitter must emit PWM signals in the correct range to allow us to map a mode to a switch position."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration.rst:48
#: 6235149203fa4286b2fb0437e546eee5
msgid "Generally the range is between 1000 to 2000 us (1.0 to 2.0 ms)."
msgstr ""

